# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
coverage

# Environment files hold secrets — never commit them.
# Only the placeholder template .env.example is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Android / Firebase files that must never be committed (onsite, Notme).
# google-services.json identifies our Firebase project (Phase 3); the
# service-account key is a real secret and lives only in Supabase secrets.
google-services.json
*service-account*.json
# Firebase's "Generate new private key" download is named like this:
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*.jks
*.keystore

# Supabase CLI local state (used only for the optional offline backup)
supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Kept local on purpose (not shared in the repository)
presentation/
Learning/
PROMPTS.md
